      "179119539": "PIONEER II",
      "188240743": "OUTPOST 32",
      "194209153": "Ammo and Supply boxes contains #V_ONE less magazine and #V_TWO fewer rounds.",
      "205278761": "FORT SANCTUARY",
      "212590513": "TIEN KWAN",
      "219493118": "The Automatons have deployed high numbers of Devastators to this planet. Prepare to encounter heavily armored enemies.",
      "222072050": "VOG-SOJOTH",
      "230047501": "PATHFINDER V",
      "255562771": "CONCERNING NUMBER OF MONOLITHS",
      "257295247": "Parts for the Democracy Space Station are prefabricated all over the Galaxy, then shipped here to await assembly.",
      "265392480": "GAR HAREN",
      "276813339": "TOR E",
      "276825548": "A mutated strain of Terminids has been reported on this planet. Expect to encounter cunning hunter bugs.",
      "280230815": "GLOOM BASE BRAVO",
      "288468253": "SLIF",
      "289898661": "MIDASBURG",
      "295451118": "Democracy Space Station construction is well underway. The local economy is flourishing as the planet’s populace has centupled, and all the Galaxy can feel their democratic fervor.",
