      "863969201": "MYRADESH",
      "867908736": "WORTHY I",
      "870181849": "ALTA V",
      "877629863": "BLISTICA",
      "900034221": "High numbers of enemy Hulks have been reported on this planet. Prepare to encounter heavily armored enemies.",
      "901564350": "DSS crews maintain deployment of a 24-hour rotating fleet of Eagle Fighters from the massive three-tiered Convocation Bay, supporting all Helldiver operations on the planet with close air support and halting enemy offensives for a short time. ",
      "909845190": "MASTIA",
      "916505227": "KARLIA",
      "916548545": "FORI PRIME",
      "920622126": "ARLIA",
      "944387173": "PANDORA BASE",
      "948019727": "SKITTER",
      "953532392": "OUTPOST ALPHA II",
      "954678793": "ZEFIA",
      "965162446": "PROBABILITY",
      "973640366": "OASIS",
      "985262540": "One of 3 Maximum Security Cities. Impregnable to Tyranny; the future of the Federation.",
      "989037070": "Extraction takes #V_TWO seconds less.",
      "992619516": "ZEGEMA PARADISE",
      "996702475": "PHERKAD SECUNDUS",
      "1003401731": "VINDEMITARIX PRIME",
      "1009772021": "UNINHABITABLE SYSTEM",
      "1017745296": "Terminid Dragonroaches menace the skies of this planet. Prepare to encounter airborne enemies.",
      "1019995927": "UVP DELTA",
      "1025296589": "MINDLESS MASSES",
      "1031846155": "EMERIA",
      "1035721014": "GREAT EXPEDITIONARY FLEET YARD",
      "1040794349": "PLENTYFUL STIMS",
      "1048514854": "FRACTURED PLANET",
      "1048855585": "POLLUX 31",
      "1057123789": "The former site of the Center of Science. Once a beacon of technology, it now lies in ruins following a violent Terminid assault.",
      "1066909283": "SHALLUS",
      "1067047599": "HELLDIVER TRAINING FACILITIES",
      "1070913489": "RD-4",
      "1083476041": "PIPIONEM",
      "1098467888": "CYBORGS",
      "1105824679": "HORT",
      "1114624260": "Construction of the Democracy Space Station is nearing completion. This project, which has employed millions, will soon take its place among the greatest achievements of Democracy.",
      "1122436356": "Battlefield pickups on all planets contain <i=1>#AMOUNT%</i> more ammo.",
      "1125879968": "Heavy SEAF Presence",
      "1131505083": "Conventional SEAF forces are heavily deployed across this planet, and may directly support Helldiver missions. ",
      "1134814559": "A mutation causes Terminids on this planet to generate excess hormonal spores, which drive other similarly mutated Terminids into a frenzy. Prepare to face enemies that bolster each others' speed.",
      "1137964607": "SKAT BAY",
      "1143724091": "DARIUS II",
      "1147063964": "The flagship Maximum Security City. Impregnable to Tyranny; the future of the Federation.",
      "1147205144": "SPORE BURST STRAIN",
      "1150711238": "NEW HOPE CITY",
      "1151272818": "DIASPORA X",
      "1166279471": "DENEB SECUNDUS",
      "1173246150": "VOTE SNATCHERS",
      "1176952649": "MASSIVE ATTACK INCREASE",
      "1181673243": "WEAPONS EXPERIMENTATION",
      "1181947803": "FORT UNION",
      "1186649585": "VITAL SYSTEM",
      "1195480985": "An experimental lab has been constructed on this planet to synthesize Dark Fluid from E-711.",
      "1198664072": "The DSS fires <i=1>Orbital Barrages</i> during missions.",
      "1202698051": "SHUTTLE REPAIR BAYS",
      "1203572315": "The <i=1>Orbital Gatling Barrage</i> is experimentally modified to use incendiary rounds instead of HE rounds.",
      "1209685887": "PAYONG",
      "1211600962": "EFFLUVIA",
      "1212122769": "Enemy progress in <i=1>Defense Campaigns</i> is slowed.",
