      "3519536123": "MERAK",
      "3533018389": "The main invasion fleet of the Illuminate, from arrogant Overseers to throngs of brainwashed Super Earth civilians, are present on this planet. Exterminate on sight or else risk violent resistance, or worse, treasonous propaganda.",
